  "Description": "LUMENFALL — Unreal 5.x prototype scaffold (AGE-141). Minimal, CI-first: no maps, no Blueprints, no assets. Exists so BuildCookRun has a real .uproject to package and the `unreal` leg can flip from SKIP to PASS once a UE 5.4 toolchain lands. See docs/AGE-141_unreal_ci_decision.md.",
